    },
    {
      "displayText": "人們即使明白，\n卻還是容易會用外表來下判斷……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA501153734F7F660E767DFF0C000A537B9084662F5BB9661367037528591688684F864E0B522465B720262026001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是能看透本質的人嗎？\n如果是的話，請和我對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為我的寶可夢們\n強到讓人傷腦筋呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F80FD770B900F672C8CEA76844EBA55CEFF1F000A5982679C662F76848A71FF0C8ACB548C62115C0D62305427300200100001BE01000A56E070BA621176845BF653EF59225011000A5F3752308B934EBA50B781667B4B5462FF01001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請在準備好和我來場\n寶可夢對戰時跟我搭話。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB57286E965099597D548C62114F865834000A5BF653EF59225C0D623066428DDF6211642D8A713002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢們強到讓人傷腦筋，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意和牠們來場對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF592250115F3752308B934EBA50B781667B4BFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F548C726050114F8658345C0D623055CEFF1F001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D6230FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不對戰",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5C0D62300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明智的判斷。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果沒有看透本質的自信，\n就應該避免無謂的對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E667A7684522465B7300200100001BE01000A5982679C6C926709770B900F672C8CEA768481EA4FE1FF0C000A5C3161C98A72907F514D71218B0276845C0D62303002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢們強到讓人傷腦筋，\n而<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有信心看透牠們的本質，對吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這下對戰可真是令人期待啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF592250115F3752308B934EBA50B781667B4BFF0C000A800C00100003110000FF01014F6059B367094FE15FC3770B900F726050117684672C8CEAFF0C5C0D5427FF0100100001BE00000A90194E0B5C0D623053EF771F662F4EE44EBA671F5F85554AFF01001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別看我的寶可夢們這樣，\n牠們都是身經百戰的強者，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不小心就透露出牠們的強大力量了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5225770B621176845BF653EF5922501190196A23FF0C000A7260501190FD662F8EAB7D93767E623076845F378005FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D5C0F5FC35C31900F973251FA7260501176845F375927529B91CF4E8654623002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一邊用世人都說可愛的外表\n來讓對手疏忽大意，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n一邊全力使出招式來打垮對手……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00908A75284E164EBA90FD8AAA53EF611B768459168868000A4F868B935C0D624B758F5FFD5927610FFF0C00100001BE00000A4E00908A5168529B4F7F51FA62DB5F0F4F86625357AE5C0D624B20262026FF01001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來這麼狡猾的作戰\n對全力對戰的對手來說是行不通的呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為實力堅強這個本質都被看透了嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8690199EBC72E1733E76844F5C6230000A5C0D5168529B5C0D623076845C0D624B4F868AAA662F884C4E0D901A76845462300200100001BE01000A56E070BA5BE6529B58055F379019500B672C8CEA90FD88AB770B900F4E86561B3002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算被說不要用外表來判斷，\n但其實內在看不見也猜不透。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以我們今後也繼續利用\n人們的疏忽大意吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
